Source code is found in TheProgram folder. 
-Main contains the driver and neccessary functions for the overall program
-greedy; contains the code for running a greedy algorithm solution for scheduling
-topdown; contains the code for a top down algorithm solution for scheduling
-ticket; contains the attributes of a single ticket. Meant to represent a single request to use the telescope. These requests will be sorted by the algorithm to try and find the best schedule for a made up scientific value.

Maker file is a simple generator to make files to test the main program on. It will ask for the number of "tickets" to generate. Before setting random values and names for each request.

Test files are sample files that the program can run on. From the range of 100-12k (12,000)
